# Line endings: store every text file with LF (Unix) endings, and check them out that way on
# every OS. Without this, files saved on Windows came in as CRLF, and any tool that rewrote
# one (an editor, a script) silently flipped every line -- a whole-file diff for a one-line
# change. See docs/refactor/LOG.md ("1B follow-up: line endings").
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
